etwork Flow Models','Pengaturcaraan Linear & Model Aliran Rangkaian',NULL,60,1,0),(22,10,2,'Multi-Criteria Decision Analysis in Python','Analisis Keputusan Pelbagai Kriteria dalam Python',NULL,60,1,0),(23,11,1,'Container Hardening & Runtime Policy Enforcement',' pengerasan Kontena & Penguatkuasaan Polisi Masa Jalan',NULL,120,1,1),(24,12,2,'OAuth2, OIDC & Zero-Trust Microservice Mesh','OAuth2, OIDC & Jaringan Mikroperkhidmatan Sifar-Amanah',NULL,40,1,1),(25,18,1,'Encapsulation, Inheritance & Polymorphism in Java','Enkapsulasi, Pewarisan & Polimorfisme dalam Java',NULL,60,1,1),(26,18,2,'SOLID Principles, Design Patterns & Unit Testing','Prinsip SOLID, Corak Reka Bentuk & Ujian Unit',NULL,60,1,1),(27,19,1,'Grid-Tied Inverter Topologies & PWM Control','Topologi Penyongsang Terikat Grid & Kawalan PWM',NULL,40,1,1),(28,19,2,'Battery Energy Storage & Microgrid Stability','Penyimpanan Tenaga Bateri & Kestabilan Mikrogrid',NULL,40,1,1),(29,20,1,'Industrial Heat Exchanger & Steam Cycle Analysis','Penukar Haba Industri & Analisis Kitaran Stim',NULL,120,1,1),(30,21,1,'Technology Opportunity Recognition & Lean Canvas','Pengecaman Peluang Teknologi & Kanvas Lean',NULL,60,1,1),(31,21,2,'Venture Valuation, IP Strategy & Investor Pitch','Penilaian Usaha Niaga, Strategi IP & Pembentangan Pelabur',NULL,60,1,1),(32,22,1,'RTL Synthesis & FSM Design in Verilog','Sintesis RTL & Reka Bentuk FSM dalam Verilog',NULL,80,1,1),(33,23,1,'Virtual Commissioning with Siemens NX & TIA Portal','Pentauliahan Maya dengan Siemens NX & TIA Portal',NULL,24,1,0),(34,24,1,'Convolutional & Recurrent Neural Architectures','Seni Bina Neural Konvolusi & Berulang',NULL,60,1,1),(35,24,2,'Attention Mechanisms, Transformers & RAG Deployment','Mekanisme Perhatian, Transformer & Penggunaan RAG',NULL,60,1,1),(36,27,1,'IEC 61131-3 Structured Text & OPC-UA Telemetry','Teks Berstruktur IEC 61131-3 & Telemetri OPC-UA',NULL,120,1,1),(37,26,1,'Industrial PLC Fundamentals','Asas PLC Industri',NULL,120,1,1),(38,28,1,'Encapsulation, Inheritance & Polymorphism in Java','Enkapsulasi, Pewarisan & Polimorfisme dalam Java',NULL,60,1,1),(39,28,2,'SOLID Principles, Design Patterns & Unit Testing','Prinsip SOLID, Corak Reka Bentuk & Ujian Unit',NULL,60,1,1),(41,29,1,'Edge Analytics & Predictive Anomaly Detection','Analitik Pinggir & Pengesanan Anomali Ramalan','Streaming window aggregation, lightweight edge ML models, threshold alerting, and fault diagnosis dashboards.',10,0,1),(42,31,1,'Relational Modeling & Normalization','Pemodelan Hubungan & Penormalan','Entity-Relationship modeling, functional dependencies, 1NF to 3NF/BCNF normalization, referential integrity constraints.',40,0,0),(43,31,2,'Advanced SQL Querying & Indexing','Pertanyaan SQL Lanjutan & Pengindeksan','Multi-table joins, window functions, CTEs, B-Tree and composite indexes, query plan inspection.',40,0,0),(44,31,3,'Transactions, Concurrency & Performance Tuning','Transaksi, Keserentakan & Penalaan Prestasi','ACID properties, isolation levels, deadlock diagnosis, EXPLAIN ANALYZE profiling, backup and recovery.',40,0,0),(45,32,1,'Prompt Architecture & Retrieval-Augmented Generation','Seni Bina Prom & Penjanaan Diperkaya Dapatan Semula','System prompt design, chunking strategies, embeddings, vector retrieval, grounding and citation patterns.',40,0,0),(46,32,2,'Production LLM Engineering, Evaluation & Safety','Kejuruteraan LLM Produksi, Penilaian & Keselamatan','Structured outputs, regression eval harnesses, PII redaction, prompt-injection defense, latency/cost observability.',40,0,0),(47,33,1,'Threat Landscape & Practical Cyber Hygiene','Landskap Ancaman & Kebersihan Siber Praktikal','Phishing indicators, MFA enforcement, password managers, endpoint patching, and safe file sharing.',12,0,0),(48,33,2,'Incident Triage & Tabletop Escalation Drill','Triaj Insiden & Latih Tubi Eskalasi Meja','First-hour containment steps, NACSA/MyCERT reporting channels, stakeholder communication, and recovery checklists.',12,0,0);
