,'approved','Executive Briefing: Cybersecurity Hygiene & Incident Readiness','Taklimat Eksekutif: Kebersihan Keselamatan Siber & Kesediaan Insiden','Cybersecurity & Organizational Governance','SME managers, administrative officers, and non-technical staff responsible for workplace digital security.','face_to_face',NULL,'English / Bahasa Melayu','3 weeks (3 weekend workshops)','Small and medium enterprises face rising phishing and ransomware incidents caused by everyday operational gaps rather than complex exploits, requiring concise practical training.','Focused 24-hour executive short learning programme (under 40h SLT) designed for immediate workplace readiness without academic credit or MQF level.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"industry\", \"feedback\"]','{\"feedback\": [\"LI_0005 CODL _1_.pdf\"], \"industry\": [\"SME_Cyber_Hygiene_Training_Need_2026.pdf\"]}','Combines real Malaysian phishing case studies with a hands-on tabletop incident escalation drill participants can immediately deploy at work.',24,0,NULL,NULL,'Minimum 50% on both the threat scenario quiz and the tabletop incident response exercise.','In-person facilitator-observed tabletop exercise and authenticated individual scenario quiz.','Immediate debriefing checklist feedback during workshop plus written summary within 5 working days.','[\"badge\", \"certificate\"]',NULL,'whole','na','Public UTeM MCMS verification portal with QR verification code.',NULL,NULL,1,'All curriculum materials, labs, and assessment rubrics are original UTeM works.',NULL,'2026-11-25 05:31:43',6,'2026-11-25 03:18:10','2026-11-25 05:58:02',NULL,'2026-11-25','initial',NULL,NULL);
